        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of silvery-gray hypopigmentation, neurological impairment, and confirmation of MYO5A mutation",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by genetic testing; hair microscopy supports clinical suspicion."
